# ── Old Wix URLs → their equivalents here ────────────────────────────────────
# The previous site (www.rckpm.es, Wix) had 16 indexed pages plus three copies
# of a demo "news" collection. Those URLs keep their search equity only if they
# land somewhere sensible instead of 404ing at the domain cutover. Listed before
# the SPA fallback below, because Netlify takes the first rule that matches.
#
# Blog posts need nothing: they were migrated at their original /post/<slug>.

/blog                        /insights                                       301!
/our-work                    /case-studies                                   301!
/about                       /about/our-firm                                 301!
/our-team                    /about/team                                     301!
/services-3                  /advisory                                       301!
/erp-transformation          /services/erp-enterprise-applications           301!
/cost-transformation         /services/value-creation-cost-transformation    301!
/operational-transformation  /services/transformation-outcomes               301!
/m-a-integration             /services/deal-advisory-carve-outs              301!

# Judgement calls — say the word and I'll repoint either.
/associates                  /about/team                                     301!
/book-online                 /contact                                        301!

# Wix template demo content that was never removed from the old site
# ("5 Most Promising Fintech Startups", "Best Smart Wearables of 2023"…),
# duplicated across three collections. Nothing here to preserve, so the whole
# tree goes to the real insights index.
/news/*                      /insights                                       301!
/news-1/*                    /insights                                       301!
/news-1-1/*                  /insights                                       301!
/news                        /insights                                       301!
/news-1                      /insights                                       301!
/news-1-1                    /insights                                       301!

# SPA fallback: if a prerendered file exists for the path Netlify serves it;
# otherwise fall back to the app shell so client-side routes never 404.
/*  /index.html  200
